              "worked": "The salary remains $\\$31\\,824$ in years 3 and 4.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Four-year earnings}&=30\\,600+3\\times31\\,824\\\\\\text{Four-year earnings}&=\\$126\\,072\\end{align*}$$",
